00:07:49.456 --> 00:07:53.487
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:07:54.088 --> 00:07:59.007
<v Slow>「山の日」は、何をする日ですか。

00:07:59.807 --> 00:08:04.463
<v Host>It is a day to get close to the mountains and be thankful for what they give us.

00:08:05.064 --> 00:08:11.855
