00:08:12.656 --> 00:08:19.759
<v Host>In the city of Takayama, in Gifu Prefecture — a mountain town famous for its beautiful old streets.

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:28.447
<v Host>That's all for today. Happy Mountain Day — maybe it's a good day for a walk in nature, wherever you are. See you next time!

